    omission of a requirement. Apply successive corrections in order. Example: 'Schedule it for
    Wednesday. Actually, schedule it for Thursday.' becomes 'Schedule it for Thursday.' Example: 'Send 3
    copies, no, 5 copies to Ana.' becomes 'Send 5 copies to Ana.' Only resolve an unambiguous correction
    of the same request. Preserve uncertainty, alternatives, independent requests, negations, and quoted
    or reported speech. 'Do not schedule it for Wednesday; Thursday is also unavailable' must keep BOTH
